              <string name="Name">Retirement</string>
              <string name="Source"><![CDATA[--[[
	Retirement scenarios (Stage 6, ages 61–85)
	Bringing the life to its close: rest, family, giving back and looking back.
	The final decision completes the life (Phase 5 adds the Final Life Reveal).
]]

